    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ぷ、プロデューサー……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "驚かせてすまん\r\n声かけるタイミング逃してさ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "い、いえ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あの……見てましたか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　何をだ？\r\nそういえば、何かいいことあったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………それです",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、そうだったのか\r\n全然気にするようなことじゃないと思うけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "知られたくないわけじゃないんですけど\r\n色々と緩んでいたので……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織が嬉しそうにしてると\r\n俺は嬉しいけどなぁ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいことだったんだろ？\r\nよかったら俺にも教えてくれないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………\r\nプロデューサー、たまに言い方がずるいですよね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ええっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "SNSで検索をしていました",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーが言っていたように\r\n単語を変えて",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おっ！　どうだった？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "身に余る評価をいただいているなと\r\nおまけがなんのことか、実はわかっていないんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それな\r\n最初に話があったろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『基本的にずっとカメラを回しているから、\r\nどこを使うかはわからない。そのつもりでいてくれ』って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだ配信見てないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "その……\r\nちょっと勇気が出なくて、まだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なので、本編でどのカットが使われているかも\r\n知らないんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、見たほうがいいぞ\r\nSNSの評価が嬉しかったなら、なおさら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "もしかして、監督に理解について言われているところが\r\n使われているとかですか……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは見てのお楽しみだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー、いじわるですね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "心外だな、俺は灯織に直接見てほしい一心だぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "もう。そこまで言われたら\r\n今見るしかなくなるじゃないですか……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それくらい早く見てほしいってことだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
