  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "風野さんはアイドルなんだよね\r\nこうして演技するのってどう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "bgm": "015"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "自分じゃない人になるって、本当に難しいです……\r\nみなさんのこと尊敬します",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040020050",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "俺は歌いながら踊るってすごいなって思うけど\r\n隣の芝は青く見える、みたいなことなのかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ、かもしれません",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "同じグループのさ、櫻木さんと八宮さん？\r\nソロでも仕事してるんだっけ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですね、少しずつユニット以外の仕事も増えてきました",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふたりともアイドルとしても素敵ですし、\r\nもっと色んな人に知ってもらえたら嬉しいなって",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………すみません、身内を褒めすぎました",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "ああ、ごめんね、そうじゃなくて\r\nなんかいいね、そういうの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "俺は、仲がいい人や同じ事務所の人はいても\r\nいつも一緒に活動する人はいないからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "羨ましくなっちゃったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そう言っていただけるととっても嬉しいです……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "…………\r\nあ～これは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011040270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……？　どうかされましたか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201104/2002011040270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "いんや\r\n監督がしたり顔しそうだなって思っただけ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
